    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c218a0f6-f663-5335-a4af-c7802dbe0880" activityNameId="0aebbb07-68d5-525c-ade8-39bb2d7d6220" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roads, company, internal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roads, company, internal
All data is referred to meter2*year. Construction data is based on material expenditures for Swiss 2nd class roads.;
UUID: 59d36eb4-73ce-3077-b1fb-b1419ee0f623
Inventory for construction and operation of the traffic area (roads and parking) on company sites.  The inventory includes processes for the supply of used materials such as gravel and bitumen . NMVOC emissions from bitumen are included. Transport of materials to the constructions site has been taken into account. Also, de-icing with sodium chlorid is accounted for. Energy cosumption due to lighting is excluded as well as weed control and marking.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Swiss state of the art technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and own calculations. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_59d36eb4-73ce-3077-b1fb-b1419ee0f623.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
